     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Crisaborole 2% ointment (PDE4 inhibitor): mild to moderate disease, age 2 and older, 2 times a day; not on mucous membranes; burning or stinging is the most common adverse effect"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
