      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Ruxolitinib 1.5% cream (JAK inhibitor): short-term, noncontinuous use in immunocompetent patients 12 and older not controlled on other topicals; thin layer 2 times a day to up to 20% of body surface for up to 8 weeks"
     }
    ]
   }
